(BALAY-INN RENTAL MARKETPLACE - USER MANUAL & SUPPORT GUIDE) Tj T*
(==========================================================) Tj T*
(Version 2.5 | Platform: Android \(Kotlin & Jetpack Compose\) | Room SQLite) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. OVERVIEW & APPLICATION CAPABILITIES) Tj T*
(Balay-Inn connects verified tenants, direct property owners, licensed real estate) Tj T*
(brokers, property managers, and authorized representatives across the Philippines.) Tj T*
(- Philippine Geographic Hierarchy: Filter rentals across Country -> Province -> City -> Barangay) Tj T*
(- Interactive Map: Visual pins, pinch-to-zoom clusters, and Search this area bounds) Tj T*
(- Listed By Filter: Direct Owners, Licensed Brokers, Managers, Caretakers, Representatives) Tj T*
(- In-Person Viewing Scheduler: Instant booking with push-through notifications) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SEARCHING & EXPLORING PROPERTIES) Tj T*
(- Compact Search Bar: Streamlined 40dp search bar with Map/List toggle and Filter button) Tj T*
(- Filter Modal: Cascading geographic location, Property types, Price budget slider,) Tj T*
(  Listed By poster authority chips, and Authorized Posters Only toggle switch) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. POSTING RENTAL PROPERTIES \(HOST FLOW\)) Tj T*
(Navigate to the Post tab to complete the 5-step listing wizard:) Tj T*
(Step 1: Listing Basics & Authority | Step 2: Geographic Hierarchy) Tj T*
(Step 3: Specifications & Amenities | Step 4: Photo Gallery | Step 5: Proof of Ownership) Tj T*
