(BALAY-INN RENTAL MARKETPLACE - USER MANUAL & SUPPORT GUIDE \(Page 2\)) Tj T*
(==================================================================) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. SCHEDULING VIEWINGS & IN-APP CHAT) Tj T*
(- Tap Schedule Viewing on any property to choose date and preferred time slot.) Tj T*
(- Hosts receive push notifications and can Accept, Reschedule, or Decline requests.) Tj T*
(- Tap Chat with Host to message directly with pinned property details.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. PROFILE, APPEARANCE & LOWER DASHBOARD LOG OUT) Tj T*
(- Profile Tab: Tap Profile on the bottom navigation bar to view your account details.) Tj T*
(- Edit Profile Modal: Tap Edit on your profile card to update name, phone, email, and role.) Tj T*
(- Appearance Mode: Tap the little moon/sun icon on the top right to switch Dark/Light mode.) Tj T*
(- Push Notifications: Toggle push through alerts easily via the dedicated switch.) Tj T*
(- Lower Dashboard Log Out: Scroll to the bottom of the Profile page to access the) Tj T*
(  Account Session card and tap the red Log Out button.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS \(FAQ\)) Tj T*
(Q: How do I filter properties posted only by direct owners?) Tj T*
(A: Open Explore -> tap Filter -> select Direct Owner under Listed By or toggle Authorized Posters.) Tj T*
(Q: Where is the Log Out button?) Tj T*
(A: Tap Profile on bottom nav, scroll down to the Account Session card, and tap Log Out.) Tj T*
(Q: Does the app work offline?) Tj T*
(A: Yes. All properties and favorites are stored locally in Room SQLite.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Support Email: support@balay-inn.ph | Helpdesk: verification@balay-inn.ph) Tj T*
ET
